Subject: Re: Vertical line at a date
Message-ID: <z5vPDpOEiqI.Ok0J9nCdkHAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <z5vPDpOEiqI.OxPHui5Nhr0J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <z5vPDpOEiqI.OxPHui5Nhr0J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
