Subject: Re: How to write counts in stacked bars
Message-ID: <BbugM-rDxN4.Q7lktBtLNtoJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <BbugM-rDxN4.32EJ3mSb5qAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
